                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Grinding: Each successful die in the initial attack roll generates one additional die. Ordinary successes on these additional dice do not generate further dice. Critical Successes explode normally throughout the roll.</characteristic>
