                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">When a COG is killed within 8″ and line of sight of this character, choose one of that COG’s traits to record. Each trait can only be recorded once. For the remainder of the game, this character gains +1 die on ATTACK and REFLEX rolls against COGs for each recorded trait the opposing COG possesses.</characteristic>
