                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">While occupying a Place of Power, this character may perform an INTERACT ACTION to photograph it. This grants the Character +1 POWER for the remainder of the game (to a maximum of +3). Each Place of Power can only be photographed once by this character. After photographing three different Places of Power, it also gains +1 die on REFLEX TESTS.</characteristic>
